      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: I'd like a separate gene-gene co-expression network for each of 20 hypothalamus samples, with a p-value for every connection so I can keep only the significant ones. The values are centered per gene. I'm not sure whether our pipeline log-transformed them before export.\nUser follow-up: Yes"
